Title: "Negative Int"
Id: "527184e8-9722-4df8-b5b2-a3b12ec6ab22"

Text: "A `negative:` group with a `int:` section records the `negative integer` classification.

```mlg-fragment
[negative.integer]
negative:
int:
is: \"negative integer\"
```

These groups are open-text metadata. The heading is optional and, when present, is a label header."
Id: "8ce421d5-5668-466b-a6af-8a5019d98df8"
